Description:
Libraries for executing federated programs and computations.

Local Modifications:

- fcp/confidentialcompute/cose.cc
  fcp/confidentialcompute/cose_test.cc

  These files wire up //components/cbor (which Chromium uses) instead of
  libcppbor.

- fcp/client/cache/file_backed_resource_cache.h
  fcp/client/secagg_runner.cc

  Not used by Chromium, stubbed out.

- fcp/protos/*
  fcp/secagg/shared/secagg_messages.proto

  Removed unused parts, which are incompatible with Chromium.

- fcp/client/attestation/attestation_transparency_verifier.h
- fcp/client/attestation/attestation_transparency_verifier.cc

  Removed unused by Chromium record logger which introduces a large dependency
  on verification record proto, and transitively, access policy proto.
